// uefi-usb: PCI enumeration and USB (milestone 2 of fw/README.md). PciDxe
// numbers the buses and places the BARs, UsbDxe brings the xHCI controller
// in slot 1 up (bus mastering through its root port) and finds the USB
// keyboard (port 1), mouse (2) and floppy drive (3, with MikeOS's image from
// work/, read-only). F11 typed on the USB keyboard opens the boot menu.
// requires: ${WORK}/mikeos.flp
// vsim-args: -b test -U ${WORK}/mikeos.flp,ro -K 31M:F11 -c 55000000
// expect-exit: 3   (the cycle limit: the boot menu waits for a choice)
// expect-out: USB Devices total: 1 Keyboard, 1 Mouse, 1 Floppy
// expect-vga: Please select boot device:
// expect-vga: UEFI: Built-in EFI Shell
